<li>A. Surahman, (2008),“Probabilistic Seismic Hazard Assessment and Structural Performance Against Seismic Actions”, Internasional Conference on Earthquake Engineering and Disaster Mitigation, (ICEEDM08), 14 - 15 April 2008, Jakarta</li>
